WEBVTT

00:10:57.412 --> 00:11:02.246
it's because he really enjoys the
submissive behavior of others

00:11:02.537 --> 00:11:06.996
and that I think we can compare
with some human leadership.

00:11:07.412 --> 00:11:09.121
Would you agree with that?

00:11:09.371 --> 00:11:11.079
Oh, it's hard to disagree with that one.

00:11:11.579 --> 00:11:15.787
Yes, I would agree, especially when we
start to see those differences vary from

00:11:15.787 --> 00:11:19.079
one culture to another. I start to
believe that there's there's

00:11:19.079 --> 00:11:22.037
a lot to be learned from studying the
way that cultures are created,

00:11:23.246 --> 00:11:26.079
which which I'd be very curious
to hear your take on,

00:11:26.079 --> 00:11:28.246
because you mentioned that chimpanzees
have cultures.

00:11:29.121 --> 00:11:31.954
They lack a lot of the tools we normally
use to build cultures. Right.